{
  "_comment": [
    "reference PNG slug (mobile/<slug>.png) -> route in the Expo web export.",
    "Slugs whose PNG is a byte-identical duplicate or a scroll/keyboard variant",
    "of another screen map to the SAME route: the app exports them as aliases,",
    "so photographing both proves nothing new, but leaving them out of the map",
    "would hide which references are covered. `scrollTo` photographs the second",
    "state of a screen that has one.",
    "auth screens need no session; everything else is shot signed in."
